    {
      "context": "Current UI: apps/NeuRoticHub/ui/HubShell.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Game recommendations are starting points, not a guarantee. Compatibility can vary by game version and graphics mode. Check the game rules before using modifications, especially online.",
