    {
      "context": "Saved next-launch preference: Hotfix/RestoreComputeSignature",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Restores compute state after injected rendering work. Automatic retains GPU-dependent Capcom game rules; Dragon's Dogma 2 enables this automatically on non-NVIDIA GPUs.",
