      ],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Captura el siguiente fotograma listo. El menú NeuRotic se excluye; se mantienen otras superposiciones."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "centred on grey. A flat grey frame there means it is doing nothing.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.centred_on_grey_a_flat_grey_frame_there_means_it_24ca8bd7",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "centrado en gris. Un fotograma gris plano ahí significa que no está haciendo nada."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Changes the Model resolution for every additional pass at once: Pass 2 through the selected final pass. It never changes Pass 1. Dragging previews the shared percentage; releasing commits that percentage to all additional passes and rebuilds them once.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.changes_the_model_resolution_for_every_additiona_18dd4d5f",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Cambia la resolución del modelo para cada pasada adicional a la vez: desde la pasada 2 hasta la pasada final seleccionada. Nunca cambia la pasada 1. Arrastrar ofrece una vista previa del porcentaje compartido; soltar confirma ese porcentaje para todas las pasadas adicionales y las reconstruye una vez."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Choose a target and analyze the current game scene.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.choose_a_target_and_analyze_the_current_game_sce_941febc9",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Elija un objetivo y analice la escena actual del juego."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "Chooses how a sub-native model edit returns to full size. Matched residual enlarges only the model's difference and generally preserves colour better.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.chooses_how_a_sub_native_model_edit_returns_to_f_28680eb0",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Elige cómo una edición del modelo subnativo regresa al tamaño completo. El residual coincidente amplía solo la diferencia del modelo y generalmente conserva mejor el color."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "Chooses the filter that averages this pass's above-native model answer back to the full-resolution frame. It applies only above 100 percent.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.chooses_the_filter_that_averages_this_pass_s_abo_5580a1dd",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Elige el filtro que promedia la respuesta del modelo por encima de la resolución nativa de esta pasada hacia el fotograma de resolución completa. Solo se aplica por encima del 100 por ciento."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "Chooses this pass's reversible proxy/composition path. Soft-knee is the shipped default; the Neutwo modes remain experimental.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.chooses_this_pass_s_reversible_proxy_composition_cd4462d7",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Elige la ruta de composición/proxy reversible de esta pasada. Soft-knee es el valor predeterminado de fábrica; los modos Neutwo siguen siendo experimentales."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Classic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size",
