      "translation": "Es cómo ves de un vistazo que el escaneo está RASTREANDO en lugar de"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "its reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its",
