      "control": "label",
      "english": "Present submissions",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.present_submissions_1c5d338e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Envíos de Present"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Proxy composition",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.proxy_composition_cf6178ff",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Composición de proxy"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Proxy is the picture handed to the model -- if that looks wrong, the white point",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.proxy_is_the_picture_handed_to_the_model_if_that_9a0bd5ff",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "El proxy es la imagen entregada al modelo; si eso se ve mal, el punto blanco"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "Proxy is the picture handed to the model -- if that looks wrong, the white point\nis wrong and nothing downstream can be judged.\n\nDifference shows what the model actually changed, amplified twenty times and\ncentred on grey. A flat grey frame there means it is doing nothing.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.proxy_is_the_picture_handed_to_the_model_if_that_d99911fa",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "El proxy es la imagen entregada al modelo; si eso se ve mal, el punto blanco\nestá mal y no se puede juzgar nada en etapas posteriores.\n\nLa diferencia muestra lo que el modelo realmente cambió, amplificado veinte veces y\ncentrado en gris. Un fotograma gris plano allí significa que no está haciendo nada."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Proxy (what the model sees)",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.proxy_what_the_model_sees_c4cf3eb8",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Proxy (lo que ve el modelo)"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Purely a readout. It changes nothing.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.purely_a_readout_it_changes_nothing_1dd3196c",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Puramente una lectura. No cambia nada."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Puts the edited frame on the other side.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.puts_the_edited_frame_on_the_other_side_6301db7f",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Coloca el fotograma editado en el otro lado."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "tooltip",
      "english": "Puts the edited frame on the other side.\n\nWorth doing once you have decided which you prefer: the eye is not\neven-handed about left and right, and a difference can read as an\nimprovement purely from where it sits. If the same side still wins after\nswapping, it is the pass you are seeing and not the placement.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.puts_the_edited_frame_on_the_other_side_worth_do_14f1fea8",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Coloca el fotograma editado en el otro lado.\n\nVale la pena hacerlo una vez que haya decidido cuál prefiere: el ojo no es\nimparcial con respecto a izquierda y derecha, y una diferencia puede interpretarse como una\nmejora puramente por dónde se encuentra. Si el mismo lado sigue ganando después de\nintercambiar, es el pase lo que está viendo y no la ubicación."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "status",
      "english": "Quality active: Post-SR after native DLSS upscale.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.quality_active_post_sr_after_native_dlss_upscale_08cd00d8",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [
        "DLSS"
      ],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Calidad activa: Post-SR después de mejora nativa de DLSS."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "status",
      "english": "Quality requested: waiting for a successful Post-SR evaluation.",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.quality_requested_waiting_for_a_successful_post__3abcce55",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Calidad solicitada: esperando una evaluación exitosa de Post-SR."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Raise it until the picture stops improving. Past that point it does not",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.raise_it_until_the_picture_stops_improving_past__afe1cd8c",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Súbalo hasta que la imagen deje de mejorar. Más allá de ese punto no"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_Menu.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "rarely anywhere near 1. Measured in Monster Hunter Wilds it takes 16 or more",
      "id": "ingame.dlssnr-menu.rarely_anywhere_near_1_measured_in_monster_hunte_b5d7c17e",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "dlssnr-menu",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "rara vez cerca de 1. Medido en Monster Hunter Wilds toma 16 o más"
    },
