    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Each internal FSR4 preset is tuned for a specific resolution.\nSelecting an FSR4 preset won't change the in-game\nupscaler preset!!!\n\nPreset 0 is meant for FSR Native AA\nPreset 1 is meant for Quality/Ultra Quality\nPreset 2 is meant for Balanced\nPreset 3 is meant for Performance\nPreset 4 is meant for DRS\nPreset 5 is meant for Ultra Performance",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.each_internal_fsr4_preset_is_tuned_for_a_specifi_afaa6767",
      "line_breaks": true,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Cada preajuste interno de FSR4 está ajustado para una resolución específica.\n¡Seleccionar un preajuste de FSR4 no cambiará el preajuste\ndel escalador en el juego!\n\nEl preajuste 0 es para FSR Native AA\nEl preajuste 1 es para Calidad/Calidad Ultra\nEl preajuste 2 es para Equilibrado\nEl preajuste 3 es para Rendimiento\nEl preajuste 4 es para DRS\nEl preajuste 5 es para Rendimiento Ultra"
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "control": "label",
      "english": "Each internal FSR4 preset is tuned for a specific resolution.",
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.each_internal_fsr4_preset_is_tuned_for_a_specifi_f5ebeec7",
      "line_breaks": false,
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "revision": 1,
      "section": "menu-common",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "translation": "Cada preajuste interno de FSR4 está ajustado para una resolución específica."
    },
    {
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
